finance officer, if the county finance officer has an office at the county seat, or the office of the
county auditor.
953 (iii) The governing body shall file a copy of the operating and capital budget with the state auditor
within 30 days after the day on which the operating and capital budget is adopted.
956 (iv) The governing body may during the budget period amend the operating and capital budget of an
enterprise or other special fund by resolution.
